dates wasm_proto_input_renamed v1
description "The same file as ../wasm_proto_input.cal, with the alias the note of its W001 gives; check says nothing, and every target takes it. Its own alias differs from the other file's only so that the two go through the targets side by side"

inputs
  received : date  range >=2026-01-01 <=2026-01-31
  proto : int range >=0 <=3

date due = received
  + proto days
